[0.005, "o", "\u001b[4;1H\u001b[90m└───────────────────┴─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\r\n\u001b[39m                                                                                                                       \r\n\u001b[36m\u001b[1m## 9. Attribution\u001b(B\u001b[m                                                                                                      \u001b[8;1H\u001b[97m\u001b[1mStealc v2\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[97m with high confidence: the literal builder path\u001b[93m C:\\builder_v2\\stealc\\json.h\u001b[97m; the family-canonical Base64+RC4\r\nstring table with runtime API resolution; base64(JSON) HTTP C2 with\u001b[93m create/loader/upload_file/done\u001b[97m verbs and\u001b[93m hwid\u001b[97m/\u001b[93mbuild\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[97mregistration; loader task triad\u001b[CEXE/Pow\u001b[2CShell-IEX/MSI; CIS-locale exclusion (classic\u001b[CRussi\u001b[Cn-speaking M\u001b[CaS etiquette —\r\nS\u001b[Cealc\u001b[Cis sold as\u001b[Cmalwar\u001b[C-as-a-service on\u001b[CRu\u001b[Csian-language forums); non-resident collect-and-self-delete\u001b[Cdesign; and\u001b[39m   \r\n\u001b[97mthe v2-era Chrome ABE bypass via I\u001b[Clevator COM from an injected sRDI DLL. The hardcoded \u001b[Cingle C2 (45.93.20.28) and\u001b[39m    \r\n\u001b[97mbuild ID identify\u001b[Cone customer campaign built 2025-04-02 with a 9-day operatio\u001b[Cal window (expiry 2025-04-11).\u001b[39m       \r\n\u001b[97mUncertain:\u001b[Coperator identity\u001b[Cbeyond \"Stealc MaaS customer\" \u001b[Cannot be\u001b[Cdetermined statically.\u001b[39m                        \r\n                                                                                                             \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[39m                                                                                         \r\n\u001b[97mResuming analysis…\r\n\u001b[39m \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[39m                \r\n\u001b[97mWriting report to report.md…\r\n\u001b[39m \r\n\u001b[97m🤖\u001b[39m                          \r\n\u001b[97mReport written to report.md (also saved in the session store as report.md)\u001b[24;87H\u001b[39m           \u001b[C                      \u001b[26;2H"]
